msgid "Rotary Libraries"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.md:34
msgid ""
"The Rotary collection is composed of many different Gazebo libraries. The "
"collection assures that all libraries are compatible and can be used "
"together."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../install.md:37
msgid ""
"The best location to know the current versions of the rotary distribution is "
"to check [collection-rotary.yaml](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/gazebo-"
"tooling/gazebodistro/master/collection-rotary.yaml)."
msgstr ""

